sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant I as Interviewer
    participant C as Candidate
    participant Code as Notebook
    I->>C: solve this, write real code
    C->>I: confirm inputs, sizes, and edge cases
    C->>Code: write the signature and the docstring first
    C->>Code: smallest correct version, no cleverness
    C->>Code: one test per edge case — empty, single, malformed
    Code-->>C: green
    I->>C: now make it handle a file that does not fit in memory
    C->>Code: switch to streaming, keep the tests passing
    Note over C,Code: readable and tested beats clever — they are reading it as code they would maintain
